      "text-contrast": "81 text elements measured against their effective background (surface + decoration layer); worst = sec-0/c-button('Start free') at 3.4 (floor 4.5); skipped=0; 3 element(s) exempt as MEASURED brand pairs (#ffffff on #ff4800)",
